  "description": {
   "en": "A complete collection of Misao Inagaki's early oneshots from the Horror M magazine, known for extremely high quality horror manga and for its splatter horror series.\n\n---\nVolume 1: The Suicide Club\n1 • Beyond the Window [1997, February]\n2 • The Lover and the Best Friend [1997, May]\n3 • The Suicide Club [1997, October]\n4 • Targeted Girlfriend [1997, November]\n5 • The Corpse Room [1997, December]\n6 • The Devil's Apartment [1998, March]\n7 • Dark Party [1998, May]\n8 • Similarities [1998, July]\n9 • Playing House Addicted [1998, October]\n10 • Kiss Me [1998, December]\n11 • Adult Phobia [1999, May] (Pen name change here)\n12 • The Seventh Mistery [1999, August]\n\n---\nVolume 2: The Head Cutter Cutout\n13 • Time Capsule [2000, February]\n14 • The Valentine Roulette [2001, February]\n15 • The Cockman Phenomenon [2001, April]\n16 • Martians [2001, June]\n17 • PHEROMONE [2001, August]\n18 • The Head Cutter Cutout [2001, October]\n19 • Supplementary Santa [2001, December]\n20 • Chiyoko \u0026 Chiyoko [2002, February]\n21 • Lord Lispe Fly's Breath [2002, June]\n22 • Joanne's Screaming Voice [2002, September]\n\n---\nVolume 3: The Brain Cure\n24 • The Sengoku Girl [2002, November]\n25 • Affection Socks [2003, January]\n26 • Mobile Inn [2003, February]\n27 • Brain Diet [2003, April]\n28 • The Destiny Woman [2003, June]\n29 • An Offering to Love  [2005, February\n30 • BRAIN CURE #1 [2005, May]\n31 • BRAIN CURE #2 [2005, October]\n32 • Torture [2006, June]\n33 • Skincare Hell [2007, March]\n34 • The Suicide Method [2007, October]\n35 • Divination Game / Cursed Game [2008, June]\n36 • A Cursed Shopping Street [2008, July]\n\n---\n\n''Missing'' April 2002 oneshot: 変身カタログ (Henshin Catalogue)\nOther missing chapters from around 2004 are just from the Alucard series.\nUranai Asobi was changed to Noroi Asobi in volume release."
  },
